    },
    {
      step: "02",
      title: "Health Check and Risk Register",
      duration: "Weeks 1 to 2",
      description: "We get the application building and deploying from a clean environment, scan dependencies for known vulnerabilities, list runtimes and services with their end-of-life dates, and review backups and monitoring. You receive a short report with a prioritised risk register and an estimate for anything urgent.",
